// This message file contains text to be used in game-supplied notes.
// Only the message line numbers 1000 or higher are valid
// Each new note begins on a multiple of 10, and can use up to 10
// lines, which must be consecutive. Each line appears in the note
// as a paragraph.

{1000}{Maria My Love,

It has been too long since I've seen your beautiful face.  Not a day has gone by during my exile that I haven't thought of you, and longed to hear your voice.  I love you and pray that one day we will again be together.

I will love you until the end of time,

Tony}

{1010}{Frank,

It is as we feared.  Doom, Octavius and Von Zemo are working on the project.  They are keeping their information in a file named the 'CR Report'.  Unfortunately I don't know where this is located.  I think I have been discovered, and if you're reading this then they've already got me.

James}

{1020}{The Nameless One

The summoning of the nameless one shall be done by one strong in the ways of magick.  They must be pure of mind and soul, and they must recite the following:  'nos voco videlicet unus ut is plagiarius of existence'}

{1030}{Otto,

Continue your research on the Sorcerer Supreme.  We must unlock the secrets of his former power if we hope to be successful.

Victor}

{1040}{Jean,

I know you go to face the dragon Fin Fang Foom with Sir Doom for the protection and safety of all Latveria.  But it is your protection and safety that matters most to me!  Please be careful and return to me as soon as possible!

Love,
Marissa}

{1050}{Marcus,

I am very proud of you son.  You have proven yourself to be one of the finest in the Latverian Guard!  I wish I was young enough to go with you on this quest to slay the dragon!  Good luck.

Love,
Dad}